F=raw/hilton/dt/familia/r2/fondos; P=raw/hilton/dt/familia/r1; O=raw/hilton/dt/familia/r2
KEEP="Image 1 is a REAL photograph of the DoubleTree hotel room: keep it exactly as it is — same walls, furniture, bedding, lamps, window, colors, light and camera framing. Do not add light patches, reflections or objects. Only add the people into this exact scene, with soft contact shadows matching the photo's light."
WHO="IDENTITY IS CRITICAL. The four people must be exactly these persons: MOTHER = images 2 and 6 (dark chestnut long wavy hair, warm brown eyes, olive-golden skin, 38); FATHER = images 3 and 7 (short dark brown hair, short stubble beard, dark brown eyes, 38); DAUGHTER = images 4 and 8 (about 9, light chestnut shoulder-length wavy hair, straight not curly, light freckles); SON = images 5 and 9 (about 7, short messy dark brown hair). Same faces, same hair, same ages."
NAT="Candid documentary moment, not posed, nobody looks at the camera. Natural relaxed expressions: soft genuine smiles, relaxed eyes looking at each other or at what they are doing, natural catchlights, no exaggerated laughing. Real skin, natural hair flyaways, realistic hands and legs in natural anatomical positions. Casual clothes in soft neutral and warm tones. Photorealistic, same exposure and grain as the original photo."
run(){ py scripts/magnific.py pro "$KEEP $WHO $2 $NAT" --refs $F/$1.jpg $P/mama-D.png $P/papa-A.png $P/nina-B.png $P/nino-A.png $O/cara-mama-D.png $O/cara-papa-A.png $O/cara-nina-B.png $O/cara-nino-A.png --aspecto carrusel --resolucion 2K --out $O/nb2-$1.png > $O/nb2-$1.log 2>&1; }
run hab-sep26 "Scene: late afternoon arrival; the son lies on his stomach on the bed with his feet up looking at a tablet, the daughter sits cross-legged next to him looking at the screen, the mother unpacks a small suitcase by the window smiling at them, the father stands next to her by the window. Kids on the bed in the middle, parents in the background." &
run hab-2camas "Scene: all four sit together on the nearer bed, leaning against the headboard pillows with legs stretched out on the duvet: the kids in the middle in pajamas choosing a movie on a tablet, the mother on the left with her arm around the daughter, the father on the right looking at the tablet over the son's shoulder. People in the lower-middle part of the frame." &
wait; tail -qn1 $O/nb2-*.log
